It is my job to be shot in the head.

1243
01:09:05,480 --> 01:09:07,277
- Is he okay?
- He's fine.

1244
01:09:07,360 --> 01:09:09,828
Luckily the bullet
hit him in the brain.

1245
01:09:10,920 --> 01:09:12,672
So,

1246
01:09:14,080 --> 01:09:15,069
what now?

1247
01:09:15,360 --> 01:09:18,557
I return to Wadiya
to participate in fair elections.

1248
01:09:30,040 --> 01:09:33,430
Let's now look back
at the wonderful events of the past year.

1249
01:09:33,520 --> 01:09:36,193
After Wadiya's
first free elections,

1250
01:09:36,280 --> 01:09:39,113
President Prime Minister
Admiral General Aladeen

1251
01:09:39,200 --> 01:09:41,634
won 98.8% of the vote.

1252
01:09:44,120 --> 01:09:47,556
But the big story today is the
marriage of President Prime Minister

1253
01:09:47,640 --> 01:09:51,235
Admiral General Aladeen
and his new bride, Zoey.

1254
01:09:55,320 --> 01:09:57,834
I now pronounce you
man and wife.

1255
01:10:07,240 --> 01:10:09,390
Are you okay, my love?
What did you step on?

1256
01:10:09,480 --> 01:10:10,674
Oh, yes! No, no.

1257
01:10:10,760 --> 01:10:14,309
It's my people's tradition.
We always smash a glass at weddings.

1258
01:10:14,400 --> 01:10:16,152
- I'm Jewish!
- What?

1259
01:10:16,240 --> 01:10:17,468
Mazel tov!

1260
01:10:22,280 --> 01:10:23,235
Are you okay?

1261
01:10:24,240 --> 01:10:26,800
That's fine.
I don't mind. It's great!

1262
01:10:27,240 --> 01:10:28,878
Come here, my love.

1263
01:10:47,800 --> 01:10:49,552
Jachnoon, President
Prime Minister Aladeen.

1264
01:10:49,640 --> 01:10:52,837
Jachnoon. Nadal. I have to be back
at the palace in an hour.

1265
01:10:52,920 --> 01:10:55,070
Zoey thinks I'm at yoga.

1266
01:10:55,440 --> 01:10:56,429
I have great news.

1267
01:10:56,560 --> 01:10:59,233
We are just days
away from testing the new missiles.

1268
01:10:59,320 --> 01:11:01,197
I have re-engineered
the oxidizing ducts

1269
01:11:01,280 --> 01:11:02,679
and the payload
delivery systems.

1270
01:11:02,760 --> 01:11:07,390
But you'll be happy to know,
the missile is now pointy!

1271
01:11:08,480 --> 01:11:10,357
Who cares if it's pointy?

1272
01:11:10,440 --> 01:11:11,555
What?

1273
01:11:12,040 --> 01:11:14,235
You do.
You care if it's pointy.

1274
01:11:14,320 --> 01:11:15,912
Why would I care
about such a trivial detail?

1275
01:11:16,000 --> 01:11:18,150
Are you serious?
Are you serious right now?

1276
01:11:18,240 --> 01:11:19,229
Of course I'm serious.

1277
01:11:19,320 --> 01:11:20,673
That's why you
had me executed!

1278
01:11:20,760 --> 01:11:23,911
The shape of the missile has nothing to
do with the payload delivery.

1279
01:11:24,000 --> 01:11:26,309
That's what I said!
That's what I said the first time!

1280
01:11:26,400 --> 01:11:27,753
No, that's what I said,
and you went crazy.

1281
01:11:27,840 --> 01:11:29,114
No!

1282
01:11:32,200 --> 01:11:35,397
So, we're opening
300 Women's Centres,

1283
01:11:35,480 --> 01:11:39,234
but I'm going to have to take a
break for a little bit because

1284
01:11:39,920 --> 01:11:41,194
I'm pregnant.

1285
01:11:41,280 --> 01:11:42,395
What?

1286
01:11:45,960 --> 01:11:48,349
Are you having a boy
or an abortion?

1287
01:12:10,920 --> 01:12:11,909
Hello, gentlemen.
How you doin'?

1288
01:12:12,040 --> 01:12:13,519
Are you guys friends
of the deceased?

1289
01:12:13,600 --> 01:12:16,273
Do you want me to say this
in front of his widow?

1290
01:12:16,360 --> 01:12:17,349
I was his lover.

1291
01:12:17,440 --> 01:12:18,873
No. That is
not true.

1292
01:12:19,320 --> 01:12:21,197
I saw him perform
with the Globetrotters.

1293
01:12:21,280 --> 01:12:23,714
I thought
he was outstanding. I befriended him.

1294
01:12:23,800 --> 01:12:25,836
No, it's
a different person.

1295
01:12:25,920 --> 01:12:29,117
His message
of don't worry and being happy

1296
01:12:29,200 --> 01:12:30,315
was so powerful.

1297
01:12:30,400 --> 01:12:32,550
No, this is
Bobby McFerrin. I told you this outside.

1298
01:12:32,640 --> 01:12:34,790
Whatever the scandal
you went through,

1299
01:12:34,880 --> 01:12:36,632
you're still
the best golfer in the world.

1300
01:12:36,720 --> 01:12:37,948
Let's go.

1301
01:12:38,040 --> 01:12:40,554
Okay. Let's rehearse this.
Role play, role play.

1302
01:12:40,640 --> 01:12:43,677
So, Secretary General,
your soldiers will weep...

1303
01:12:45,120 --> 01:12:46,473
I am so sorry!

1304
01:12:46,560 --> 01:12:48,118
Listen, it was
not my fault.

1305
01:12:48,200 --> 01:12:50,475
I mean, somebody had
set the safety catch

1306
01:12:50,560 --> 01:12:52,835
to "Aladeen"
instead of "Aladeen."

1307
01:12:52,920 --> 01:12:54,069
Look, I mean,
this whole gun...

1308
01:12:57,360 --> 01:12:58,395
Zoey.

1309
01:12:59,840 --> 01:13:01,990
That's some good head!

1310
01:13:04,160 --> 01:13:06,151
That is called payback
and it feels so good!

1311
01:13:06,240 --> 01:13:08,470
How did it feel for you?
How did it feel for you?

1312
01:13:08,560 --> 01:13:10,232
I prefer it with goats.

1313
01:13:10,960 --> 01:13:12,393
Where is
the Supreme Leader?

1314
01:13:12,480 --> 01:13:13,469
No, no.

1315
01:13:13,560 --> 01:13:15,835
Now that is
called payback!

1316
01:13:16,080 --> 01:13:17,308
Oh, great!

1317
01:13:22,560 --> 01:13:25,438
Don't touch it.
Don't touch it.

1318
01:13:25,920 --> 01:13:27,194
You don't have
to touch it.

1319
01:13:27,280 --> 01:13:28,269
Sorry. I was...

1320
01:13:28,360 --> 01:13:30,112
Just give us...
We don't...

1321
01:13:30,200 --> 01:13:32,953
Just give me
a couple of millimetres to myself.

1322
01:13:34,720 --> 01:13:44,709
THE END
